# Optional. The history file is auto-detected per platform:
#   macOS   ~/.zsh_history, ~/.zhistory, ~/.histfile, ~/.bash_history, fish
#   Linux   ~/.bash_history, then the zsh files, then fish
#   Windows PSReadLine ConsoleHost_history.txt
# $HISTFILE wins when your shell exports it. Set SOURCE only to override, or
# pass --source on the command line.
#
# macOS / Linux:
# SOURCE=~/.zsh_history
#
# Windows:
# SOURCE=C:\Users\{user}\AppData\Roaming\Microsoft\Windows\PowerShell\PSReadLine\ConsoleHost_history.txt
